states, and system-energy increments.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"afaba522-5589-4f84-831e-ad747c12a0bd"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"NQubits", "[", "NN", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"HS", "=", 
