Cell["\<\
Comment: Runs the gamma sweep. For each anisotropy value, the code rebuilds \
the interaction unitaries, evaluates KDQ, RHP, and LFS diagnostics, and \
stores the results in res.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"dbf8b033-8e42-45a4-869a-f7f07d06f9df"],

